Thought: I need to retrieve all data from "capacity.csv" (bookshelf capacities) and "products.csv" (book values and weights), preserving all identifiers and coefficients. Then, I will formulate a complete integer optimization model using these parameters, with integer variables x_ij for the number of units of book j on shelf i.

